{%- doc -%}
The header's cart icon: the theme's bag and, stacked on top of it, a happy face. When a product is added to the cart the bag turns into the face for a
moment and back (CSS and script in sections/header.liquid, .header__cart-icon). While the cart has items (.has-items) the bag is filled solid with the
icon's own color. Both icons take the same size and stroke width.

@param {number} [width] - the icon width on desktop
@param {number} [mobile_width] - the icon width on mobile
{%- enddoc -%}

<span class="header__cart-icon{% unless cart.empty? %} has-items{% endunless %}">
  {%- render 'icon' with 'cart', mobile_width: mobile_width, width: width, class: 'header__cart-icon-bag' -%}
  {%- render 'icon' with 'cart-smile', mobile_width: mobile_width, width: width, class: 'header__cart-icon-smile' -%}
</span>
